  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical support for Gambella and Benishangul regions of Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the key proposed activities including support towards sector coordination, institutional capacity building (extension), and detailed mapping and popularization of key agricultural value chains targeting both refugees and host communities. 
To support the setting up of a modest FAO presence in Gambella, to serve both regions while executing the selected interventions. It is also envisaged that this initial investment will facilitate a strong advocacy and fundraising for future scale up of highly potential agricultural development activities in the Regions.</narrative>
  </description>
